  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Eli's Favorite Book Page\r\n\r\n*\"The content is all there but the page looks so boring and plain. I wanted it to feel like the book - dark and mysterious with a bit of magic to it. It just looks like a default webpage right now.\"*\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n1. Read Eli's `vision.md` to understand what they originally asked for.\r\n2. Fix the page using AI Tutor. You can:\r\n   - Update `vision.md` to be more specific, then ask AI Tutor to regenerate the page, **or**\r\n   - Prompt AI Tutor directly to fix specific issues, **or**\r\n   - Do both.\r\n\r\n> **Hint:** Think about what's missing from Eli's vision - he described the content well but left out details about how the page should look. What specific style properties could you add to capture \"dark and mysterious\"?\r\n\r\nKeep iterating and prompting AI tutor. When the page addresses Eli's feedback, click **Continue**.",
